Every network surface of a running Ritual (the footer of each site it builds or
serves, the admin site's navigation and its unauthenticated GET /api/status, and the
MCP server's instructions) states the version and licence and links to the source of
exactly that version. Someone distributing or serving a modified version builds it
with RITUAL_SOURCE_URL set to the repository holding their modifications, which is
what section 13 of the licence asks of them.

