Card data, card images, card symbols and most prices (TCGplayer, Cardmarket and
Cardhoarder) come from Scryfall (https://scryfall.com), under Scryfall's API
guidelines (https://scryfall.com/docs/api). Ritual downloads Scryfall's bulk data
rather than querying card by card, and paces the requests it does make. Scryfall is
not affiliated with this project.

Card Kingdom prices and buylist quotes come from Card Kingdom's public price list
(https://www.cardkingdom.com). Decks are imported from Archidekt, Moxfield and
MTGGoldfish, and synced with Archidekt, at the user's request and with the user's
own account where one is needed. None of these sites is affiliated with this project.
